==Northern Kurdish==

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|ckb|-}} and {{cog|sdh|گان|tr=gan}}, {{cog|hac|گای|tr=gai}}, {{cog|zza|gaene}}, {{m|zza|gainaene}}, {{cog|fa|گاییدن}}, {{cog|pal|ts=gādan}}.

In some dialects it's the animal equivalent of {{m|kmr|nan|tê niyan|t=to fuck; lit. "to put in, insert"}} or a meaner way of saying "fuck" by insinuating the person cursed at is an animal. That considered, the actual sense may have been "''to breed''" and derived from {{m|kmr|ga|t=ox; bull; stud; any male cattle}}.

In some dialects and derived terms it's used only for homosexual acts or prostitution.

